    {
        "text": "An abandoned courtyard... Is this where you live?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_173",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A few years ago, a merchant built the magnificent courtyard before you, but he disappeared without a trace during a business trip. To this day, no one knows whether he met his fate in a natural Catastrophe or man-made tragedy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "text": "But whichever the case, this courtyard has become a place of refuge for those of us with nowhere to go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_165",
        "name2": "avg_npc_164",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Old Isin brought two new faces with him...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Homeless Person"
    },
    {
        "text": "She doesn't seem all that poor, going by her looks...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Homeless Person"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_165",
        "name2": "avg_npc_164",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We need to be careful... Let's head back inside. We shouldn't pry into Old Isin's secrets.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Disheveled Person"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_173",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What's this courtyard called...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_173",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sargonian) 'The Sleeping Sargon.' That's what all those without a home have come to call this place...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like our fallen homeland, my lady. We sleep on the most extravagant corpse you can find in the whole world.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please stay the night and wait until sunrise. Only then can we leave for the heart of Reefsteep.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_173",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The land encircled by reefs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_173",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Precisely... Right in the center of the sea of sands.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_173",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The padishah and lord ameer chose to rebuild their city somewhere with far richer resources, leaving it a forgotten ruin, a land of lawlessness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be that as it may, to those who once lived in that city as well as their descendants, leaving that place behind is easier said than done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_173",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You can hire underground Messengers to do your bidding there. They will create fake identities for you and help you leave Sargon territory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, your destination is quite some distance away. Old Isin cannot guarantee you will arrive in one piece.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_173",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How is Elliot doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_173",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He is asleep, but it is safe here. You care for him more than Old Isin imagined you would. It is proof of your kindness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_173",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "He's not going to be happy if he catches you say that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_173",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, Old Isin can see it... The anger lurking in him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_173",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought you'd have met plenty of people like him. Civil unrests and skirmishes happen often in Sargon, after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_173",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The world may think there are many brave men with a lust for revenge, but there isn't. Most merely drown in their hatred, their rationality quashed by their anger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_173",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I can save him this once, and only this once.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_173",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes... Old Isin understands... His fate lies elsewhere... and his fate is bound to that gold coin of yours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_173",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why 22 years?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_173",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Arts cannot give us so-called prophecies, and no mere mortal can manipulate time. Time is the mother of all fates. All Old Isin likes to do is to wager against time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_173",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So you mean... Hm, what's wrong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_10002"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.8,
        "xstrength": 50,
        "ystrength": 50,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "(Dissatisfied hisses)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mon3tr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_173"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah... What a beautiful creature.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Old Isin can tell. The two of you depend on one another. Old Isin can tell... it is your partner.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "text": "The two of you have traveled a long, long journey together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
        "name2": "npc_10002",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's go, Mon3tr. Let's go see them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_173",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... You communicate... Your hearts are connected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Old Isin can feel that... you have complete trust in this creature... as though it is your one and only friend...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yet... you traveled on your long, arduous journey with no one but this beautiful creature...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lady, is this glory of yours replete with nothing but loneliness?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_173",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Loneliness doesn't affect my responsibilities in any way...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems we've got company. I'll go take care of them. Please stay here. Take care of Elliot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
