    {
        "text": "Where's Kal'tsit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elliot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_173",
        "name2": "avg_npc_171_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Enemies are abound. She is fending them off with her trusted partner.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_173",
        "name2": "avg_npc_171_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean that weird creature...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elliot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you looking into the distance like that? Are you worried about her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elliot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_173",
        "name2": "avg_npc_171_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Old Isin is not worried. She has a tenacious spirit. Old Isin thinks not even death can stop her in her tracks, that's why Old Isin respects her. Old Isin has a question for her...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_173",
        "name2": "avg_npc_171_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you want to ask her...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elliot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_173",
        "name2": "avg_npc_171_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "For the past hundred and some years... Old Isin has had the same dream again and again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_173"
    },
    {
        "text": "In those dreams, there stands a magnificent city among the golden sands. The city moves, and the sky seen from its towers is purer and clearer than ever...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "text": "The young pasha stands next to Old Isin, and there is always a vast, empty swath of land before our eyes. The young padishah would always begin to recount to Old Isin...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yet Old Isin is too old... Old Isin forgets. Old Isin's crimes are unforgivable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_171_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "(He's talking to himself again...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elliot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_173"
    },
    {
        "text": "Old Isin has always sought this answer. Old Isin has been waiting for someone who knows of the city and its glory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "text": "All those who had to do with the city yet live in the dream. Some have forgotten, but a great many of us still look back fondly on our homeland...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "text": "We built this city with our own hands under the padishah's leadership. A great city. Even if Catastrophes bring it to its ruins, that city is the true beginning of the Land of Reefsteep...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Sargonians of Ibut must never forget anything about Reefsteep... yet... Old Isin has forgotten... Old Isin is unforgivable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_173",
        "name2": "avg_npc_171_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been waiting for someone... to tell you what you've forgotten in your dreams?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elliot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
