    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_054"
    },
    {
        "text": "What...? Not even the highest grade arrows could harm that monster?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't have enough info to work with... She seems to be a Caster. Be careful!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sarkaz... The Lord Ameer of Ibut hired you, didn't he?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_054"
    },
    {
        "text": "You think I'm about to tell you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... The Ibuti Lord Ameer has a deep, personal grudge against Victoria. I only got a brief glimpse, so it's possible I'm mistaken, but the arrows just now were indeed Victorian.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like your real employer... The current padishah, Murad, is far more crafty than I expected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "A patient ruler, fanning the flames between the different forces without a care in the world. Perhaps he had anticipated the plans of the Columbians and the local lords ameer all along?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_054"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh, you know about the padishah, and still you dare come to Sargon? I'll never know what's going on in you Columbians' heads. What, you got Originium in your brain?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Padishah Murad wants just the box and nothing else. Give it to us, and all of us get to leave this place alive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "You haven't destroyed it, have you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Only because it isn't mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_054"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh... You're a stubborn one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Ibuti Lord Ameer's self-righteousness earned him the padishah's anger. I have no idea who hired those Columbian mercenaries, but I can at least tell you they won't be putting up a fight anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "This pointless war is coming to an end soon. Padishah Murad gave us the authority to bring all this to an end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If that were the case, why would an almighty Sargon padishah hire mercenaries to do his bidding here, instead of sending his personal guards?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_054"
    },
    {
        "text": "This has got way too much to do with Columbia, after all, but none of that matters to you and me right now. You got a decision to make here, Operations Adviser.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "All you gotta know is that there's no one coming to save you in this desert.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_10002"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "xstrength": 4,
        "ystrength": 4,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "text": "(Lightly stretches body)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mon3tr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_054"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Watch out for that creature. No idea what it actually is, but it's gonna be tricky to take it down.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sarkaz Tribal Dialect)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_054"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "You\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014No, it can't be! This isn't just normal Arts\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Devil speak? You're a Columbian! How\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sargonian) Enough!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sargonian) Talk to us in Victorian or Sargonian, or else we'll shoot!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you from Kazdel?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_054"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kazdel...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just a bedtime story for kids. I have no idea what you have to do with Sarkaz, but this doesn't change anything about the situation we're in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be quick with it and hand the box over. All the padishah wants is the tech.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This will set off the beginning of Sargon's destruction. Padishah Murad is not a scientist. He doesn't understand the devastation it can cause.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_054"
    },
    {
        "text": "He doesn't need to understand, nor do we.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is Sargon your homeland, Sarkaz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_054"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've lived in Sargon for as long as I can remember.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "We snuck around in the back alleys and hid our horns, and we lived in the filthiest of places.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Picking up arms is the only way we get to eat. It's simple. All of us are practically natural-born Infected. It's do or die, and that's what drives us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tsk\u2014So what are you saying?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Only Sarkaz with a firm will can escape the ancient language's influence. The language itself is a kind of Sarkaz witchery. What's the source of your conviction? Your mission, or your greed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_054"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, I gotta admit... Your mind trick might actually have worked. I still haven't ordered anyone to open fire. I'm still chitchatting with you with all the patience in the world, even.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "All I can see before me is a Sarkaz trying his best to survive using the simplest method he knows.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_10002"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Looks around on alert)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mon3tr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_054"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough of this crap. I thought you were a Columbian mercenary leader. Stop pussyfooting around!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Padishah Murad won't allow any Sarkaz to know his dirtiest secrets.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "You fought off all the other squads vying for this trophy. Don't you suppose the lords ameer's men were not among them, masquerading as mercenaries?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "And between the exorbitant amounts in taxes and the lives of a few Sarkaz assassins, what do you think Padishah Murad's choice will be?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_054"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course we're aware of that, but if we let you go now, does that mean we'll be raking in even more dough, or our Oripathy will be cured right away?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't get the wrong idea. We live at the padishah's mercy. We don't have a choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps I can give you a choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sarkaz Tribal Dialect)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_054"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph\u2014You want to turn us against him, and you want us to serve\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Serve Kazdel... a place we haven't so much as seen...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't make me laugh, Caster! The Sarkaz homeland? There's nothing there but a bunch of ruins! You bookworm types should know better than any of us just how much is left of Kazdel!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Get the Casters ready. Focus your fire on that monster. You two, we'll take the bitch down the first opportunity we got.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Too bad. Looks like negotiation's not on the table anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_054"
    },
    {
        "text": "This isn't even negotiation\u2014Tsk, what is this even, mercy? You're the one who's surrounded right now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, you're right... You know how to strike fear, but if we don't give the padishah an answer he's satisfied with by tomorrow, we aren't going to escape death either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like I told you, we don't have a choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Open fire!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
